{"title": "Nightsinger's Reply", "pageid": 30397, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Nightsinger's_Reply", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Nightsinger's Reply</b> is a passive feature that retaliates against enemies that hit the user with a melee attack.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>While <a href=\"/wiki/Obscured\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Obscured\">obscured</a> by shadow, the wearer deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage to attackers that hit them with a melee attack. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UND_Justiciar_ChainShirt_Magic_Passive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_Justiciar_ChainShirt_Magic_Passive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UND_Justiciar_ChainShirt_Magic_Passive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Mail\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Mail\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Dark_Justiciar_Mail_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Mail\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Mail\">Dark Justiciar Mail</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232003\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1211/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: